r-XQZ_LjwCx8kuGop4cI1W39GW0ERK6-rSy6_MmA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAOg999Tnr22wCvi1YR3dZKITNV5004BEMSf6vSIADEzg&oe=6A5B7DCE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440(2).png", "id": "668019582884268", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827273_668019586217601_4528503385569558307_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PhYmUVT8pHMQ7kNvwFI_ZzO&_nc_oc=AdpXrpq0FjYS9sm9jaeIABsREdMtlHQeDEgXNhR-7NYDwvrNe96rxc6VbKykA7F0Y9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBlr3lK_8lT9it8Rl3zXkCy7hcHla0hGS5fFD7wHJtF0A&oe=6A5B7B3D"}, "display_name": "One More Delve", "keywords": ["Dungeon", "Archery", "Bow", "Magic", "Sword"], "long_description": "**One More Delve is an intense, physics-driven dungeon crawler adventure. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve in the dungeons.**\n\n- Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed melee weapons, bows, shields, and powerful spells\n\n**Master a physics-based combat system. Slash, bash, and dismember with style**\n{693808796750877}\n{1436682780702563}\n\n**Team up in 3-player co-op to conquer the dungeons together**\n{1051661560445750}\n\n**Combine spellcasting with melee or ranged attacks to suit your style**\n{1355108305574031}\n\n**Return to the social hub to craft gear, talk about your adventures, and prepare for your next dungeon**\n{1245137219848273}\n\n\n", "short_description": "One More Delve is an intense, physics-driven dungeon crawler adventure. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve in the dungeons.\n\n- Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed melee weapons, bows, shields, and powerful spells\n- Master a physics-based combat system. Slash, bash, and dismember with style\n- Team up in 3-player co-op to conquer the dungeons together\n- Return to the social hub to craft gear, talk about your adventures, and prepare for your next du